; smoothstep-dip.ink's bar (40 x 10 x 10, pulled at 10 MPa), its yield a
; smoothstep dip to 10 MPa at x = 0.5, 4 mm each side (yield = 250 - 240 b,
; b = 3 s^2 - 2 s^3, s = 1 - |x - 0.5| / 4), and 50 MPa for x > 10.
; The least factor is at the dip: 10 / 10 = 1. The x > 10 end, of one
; material, reads 50 / 10 = 5. In the cells around the dip the interval of
; b overshoots 1, so the yield's interval lower bound is negative there.
; truth: safe fails about 1 (statics: 10 MPa along the bar against the dip's 10 MPa at x 0.5)
; truth: unsafe holds about 1 (as safe)
(import "std")
(def part (box 40 10 10))
(def sx (max 0 (- 1 (/ (abs (- x 0.5)) 4))))
(def blend (- (* 3 sx sx) (* 2 sx sx sx)))
(study s1 (shape part)
 (elastic (E 200000MPa) (nu 0.3) (yield (* 1MPa (select (- 10 x) 50 (- 250 (* 240 blend))))))
 (fix root (+ x 19)) (load pull (force 1000N 0 0) (region (- 19 x))) (res 1))
(require safe (min-safety-factor s1 > 3))
(require unsafe (min-safety-factor s1 < 3))
